Third-party components
----------------------

Megane builds on Anime4K (https://github.com/bloc97/Anime4K). The model
app/Models/Anime4K_A.mlpackage is Anime4K's Mode A network rewritten for the
Apple Neural Engine; its weights are Anime4K's own and remain under Anime4K's
MIT License. The model app/Models/Student_M.mlpackage is a smaller network
trained by Megane to reproduce Anime4K Mode A; it is part of Megane and is
licensed like the rest of this program.

